From 4ae3548436ff7bfd73a3a59ef032e3f7731bbf55 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arnold Nyamongo <arnoldnyams@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 12:30:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add a decoration-only Naija whimsy layer to every route
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A whimsical, playful layer that sits beside/behind the existing site and
changes no fonts, palette, layout structure, copy, routes, links or
functionality.

- fixed margin doodles (danfo, jollof, suya, puff puff, mango, zobo, coin,
  mascot, trophy, crown, medal, clock), each with a 2.2px dark outline,
  saturated fills and a drop shadow, plus dotted edge trails
- high-contrast sparkles, card and section sparkles, and a wavy underlined
  highlight under “Good games.”
- wavy section/page dividers, a danfo that drives across the top once, a
  footer skyline and “No wahala” sign-off
- click delight: squish, ripple, 8-12 bold sparkles, coins, confetti and a
  floating “Sharp sharp!” label for the hero CTAs (no navigation delay)
- sparkle cursor trail (desktop only), playful tooltips, a waving Naija
  vibes mascot on home, a sign-in mascot with “Oya, come in!”, focus glow
  and confetti on sign-up success
- tournament trophy + ticking clock, leaderboard crown/medals, confetti
  for the leader, wiggling NEW stickers and scroll reveals
- reduced-motion disables every animation and click effect; decorations
  are hidden/fitted on tablet/mobile without touching content
- playful loader and the “Wahala!” 404 sticker

Verified in light mode on every route: zero horizontal overflow, all
decorations visible on the first screen, every visible control hit-tested
and click-tested with zero decoration interception, plus dark mode and
reduced-motion checks.
